#: includes/admin.php:135
msgid ""
"the legacy plugin was detected. Distribution uses its own state and worker "
"while preserving the same public files. While both plugins coexist, the "
"legacy scheduled automation keeps priority to avoid duplicate execution; "
"manual regeneration can be tested from this plugin."
