#: includes/admin.php:316
msgid ""
"Feeds keep the adaptive regulator from the previous system, but work now "
"runs through the dedicated Distribution worker. Each window uses a cursor, "
"lock, and execution deadline; there is no dependency on the legacy central "
"manager."
msgstr "Los feeds conservan la regulación adaptativa; ahora usan el trabajador propio de Distribution. Cada lote utiliza cursor, bloqueo y límite de tiempo, sin depender del gestor anterior."

